<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 182 0 R
/T (This project is the CarePoint application designed to help users find hospitals in Indonesia. The application provides a list of selectable provinces and cities. It also includes important information about hospitals, such as room capacity, address, phone number, and the distance from the user's location. With an intuitive interface, CarePoint aims to improve accessibility to healthcare services for the community.)
