<<
/Title (This project is the Tilawah Tracker application, a dedicated platform designed to help users maintain consistency in reading the Al-Qur'an. The application offers structured khatam programs, such as 25-day or 30-day targets, along with a manual mode for personalized pacing. Tilawah Tracker features a smart dashboard that organizes reading tasks by prayer times and includes a "Start Reading" button that automatically directs users to their last-read page in the integrated digital Mushaf. With a clean, intuitive interface and detailed progress statistics, Tilawah Tracker aims to provide a seamless and motivating spiritual journey for the Muslim community.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 332 0 R
>>
